                <invention-title lang="en">OPTIMIZED VIDEO REVIEW USING MOTION RECAP IMAGES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed herein is a method comprising: detecting one or more motions in a video feed; generating metadata based on the one or more motions; associating the metadata with one or more frames of the video feed; receiving a motion search query; and identifying, from the metadata, one or more frames that include motion.</p>
